    "E2 dot rail: 5 entries (live had 6 — \"Build Your Soft Chews Formula\" left with the configurator), entry 2 = How We Work, hidden at <=1100px",
    "E6 \"Browse All Formulas\" keeps its outline and both of its branches — the values are identical to the live baseline at every width (12px 18px block 44px below 769px, 12px 24px inline-block above)",
