    "E4 the hero CTA smooth-scrolled to this page's #inquiry-form and came to rest on its scroll-margin-top (hash=#inquiry-form, form top 96px vs margin 96.0px, href=/contact/#quote, class carries sf-quote-cta) — live pointed the same anchor at #configurator",
    "detail page provenance: https://dev.zxpet.com/wp-content/themes/sinofresh-theme-preflight/style.css?ver=2.10.56",
    "E5 no-JS contract: dose href /contact/#quote (en) / /zh/contact/#quote (zh) and the detail anchor navigates natively to /contact/#quote (live sent it to /products/soft-chews/#configurator)",
    "E8 html.no-has appears only when CSS.supports refuses selector(): negative control False / with stub True (stub ran 1 time(s))",
    "E8 H2b2 baseline under html.no-has at 480px: .sf-float-stack bottom=132px, .trp-language-switcher bottom=68px — after configurator.css is deleted these must come back to the same values",
    "consent banner still present after Accept All -> hidden for the shots",
    "E9 six real screenshots (37-54 KB, the band framed clear of the sticky chrome at every width), taken at a raised viewport so nothing is painted blank; geometry above remains the evidence"
